Subject: [PATCH] sdk: create parent directories for generated driver links

GPL archives omit some proprietary driver directories. Permit preparation
of public kernel targets without requiring those driver implementations.
No stub driver or replacement exports are introduced.

--- a/bcmdrivers/Makefile
+++ b/bcmdrivers/Makefile
@@ -34,0 +35 @@
+	$$(Q)mkdir -p $$(dir $$@)
@@ -63,0 +65 @@
+	$$(Q)mkdir -p $$(dir $$@)
@@ -106,0 +109 @@
+	$$(Q)mkdir -p $$(dir $$@)
